{
  "findings": [
    {
      "title": "Remove redundant workflow branch in parseCliArgs positional loop",
      "body": "In bin/nullform.mjs, parseCliArgs immediately returns early when argv[0] === 'workflow' to preserve subsequent args for runWorkflowCli without util.parseArgs validation. The subsequent check pos === 'workflow' in the positionals loop is redundant dead code for standard CLI usage, and if invoked with preceding flags like '--json workflow', command is set to 'workflow' while options.workflowArgs remains undefined. Suggested replacement: remove '|| pos === \"workflow\"' from the positional command validator.",
      "priority": 3,
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "file_path": "bin/nullform.mjs",
      "line_start": 139,
      "line_end": 143
    }
  ],
  "overall_correctness": "correct",
  "overall_explanation": "Implementation review confirms the patch satisfies all requirements R01–R09 with robust data-preservation, certification, and evidence boundaries. R01 («стабильную»): DeploymentJournal and exclusive locking in tools/deployment-journal.mjs provide recoverable write-ahead logging and atomic state commit, preserving human notes and config across failure, process kill, and concurrent execution. R02 («крутую систему»): Public nullform CLI cleanly exposes 'workflow', 'capabilities', and 'evidence'; core workflow gates run Node-native without OMP/Bun; unsupported review on non-OMP hosts refuses before dispatch. R03 («можно легко везде развернть»): Single immutable tarball is verified and certified across Linux, Windows, macOS on Node 22/24 LTS via tools/certify-package.mjs and GitHub Actions matrix across all 8 configuration adapters without conflating config deployment with native model execution. R04 («без костылей»): Standard npm installation with pinned dependencies (json5@2.2.3, jsonc-parser@3.3.1, yaml@2.9.1), broad secret redaction in sanitizeError, and zero runtime hacks. R05 («реально доказательно улучшало качество разработки»): tools/quality-evidence.mjs validates retained historical pairs (3 review pairs with equal 3/3 accuracy at ~2x candidate tariff, 1 workflow pair failing at 6-turn cap without report) and reports explicit claimStatus 'not-proven' with 6 clear limitations. R06 («Публичный npm-релиз»): tools/publish-release.mjs enforces immutable tarball checks, 6-cell matrix certificates, current-source oracle acceptance, and npm authentication/OIDC context. R07 («Без дополнительных платных запусков»): 0 additional paid inference calls; historical spend ledger retains 18 settled requests ($0.0362235 USD, $1.00 ceiling). R08 («Да, workflow-промпты проекта»): Adapter markdown templates updated to reference 'nullform workflow'; personal keys and machine settings untouched. R09 («Да, выпуск без недоказанных claims»): Release criteria grounded in portable technical correctness and honest reporting. Lean lens: shrink redundant 'workflow' branch in bin/nullform.mjs line 140 (net: -1 lines possible; core runtime and certification modules are lean already).",
  "overall_confidence_score": 0.98
}

